1
00:00:00,387 --> 00:00:04,687
Did you express everything
that you wanted to express?
言いたいことは
全部言えた？

2
00:00:04,707 --> 00:00:06,727
Did we get that, like...
ちゃんと聞けたかな

3
00:00:07,047 --> 00:00:10,127
Because I got to go in 20 minutes.
I got to go. I got to leave soon.
あと20分で　出なきゃいけないんだ
もうすぐ行かないと

4
00:00:10,147 --> 00:00:13,187
I ain't going to lie to you, Kanye.
I'm going to be honest with you.
ウソはつかないよ、Kanye
正直に言う

5
00:00:15,387 --> 00:00:17,567
You didn't have to do this.
あんたはここに
来なくてもよかった

6
00:00:18,477 --> 00:00:20,787
You could have went
to Stephen A. Smith.
Stephen A. Smithのとこに
行ってもよかった

7
00:00:18,477 --> 00:00:22,457
Stephen A. Smith：ESPNの名物コメンテーター

8
00:00:21,267 --> 00:00:23,607
You could have went to Oprah.
You could have went to anybody.
Oprahでもいいし
誰のとこでもよかった

9
00:00:22,477 --> 00:00:27,077
Oprah：Oprah Winfrey。アメリカを
代表するトーク番組司会者

10
00:00:23,627 --> 00:00:25,227
But you know what you did?
でもあんたは

11
00:00:25,537 --> 00:00:27,107
You came back to the culture.
カルチャーに戻ってきてくれた

12
00:00:27,697 --> 00:00:31,117
Boy, they did. Don't clap yet.
まだ拍手するな

13
00:00:34,777 --> 00:00:39,117
We could have been scared,
and guess what? We were scared.
ビビってもおかしくなかったし
実際ビビってた

14
00:00:40,547 --> 00:00:41,787
But you're my brother.
でもあんたは兄弟だから

15
00:00:42,387 --> 00:00:44,567
I like that I have that
effect on people.
人をそういう気持ちにさせるのは
悪くないね

16
00:00:46,167 --> 00:00:49,127
I like that I have that... You don't
want to let me finish my speech?
「悪くないね」って…
俺に最後まで言わせない気？

17
00:00:49,527 --> 00:00:50,967
Go ahead, go ahead, go ahead.
どうぞどうぞ

18
00:00:52,467 --> 00:00:54,587
Wait, wait. Do you not
think you have the
待って
俺たちがあんたのやることを

19
00:00:54,607 --> 00:00:57,687
effect that we really
love what you do?
本気で愛してるって
わかってる？

20
00:00:58,497 --> 00:01:01,107
I like that. I like the love,
and I like the fear also.
それもいい　愛されるのもいいし
恐れられるのもいい

21
00:01:01,447 --> 00:01:04,017
Nah, but on the cultural standpoint,
いや、カルチャー的にさ

22
00:01:04,037 --> 00:01:06,967
we love what you do.
You mean so much to us.
俺たちはあんたを愛してる
すごく大事な存在なんだよ

23
00:01:07,847 --> 00:01:09,897
Good Morning America?
Nah, they don't give a f**k.
Good Morning America？　あいつらは
何とも思ってない

24
00:01:07,847 --> 00:01:11,827
Good Morning America：ABCの朝の情報番組

25
00:01:09,917 --> 00:01:12,847
And by the way, because that's
the thing, Tucker Carlson,
それにTucker Carlsonだって

26
00:01:11,847 --> 00:01:17,777
Tucker Carlson：Fox Newsの司会者。
2022年10月にYeをインタビューした

27
00:01:12,867 --> 00:01:15,247
they're going to help me
up to the point where I'm,
俺がトランプを支持してる
ところまでしか

28
00:01:15,267 --> 00:01:17,777
like, supporting Trump, right?
助けてくれない

29
00:01:17,797 --> 00:01:18,976
That's all they care about.
あいつらが気にするのは
それだけだ
